|  1> # SCOPE 4  |  Tier 2 minima: B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-TZVP, TightOpt + FREQ
|  2> # State: V-I2 hydrolysed intermediate  |  register row: V-I2-T2-V05
|  3> # Start: TIER 1 accepted V-I2_canonical (first Al-O bond broken, two silanols).
|  4> # Why: pins the depth of the opened-framework state (342 kJ/mol below the zero).
|  5> # Expected: minimum, 0 imaginary modes. If a low-frequency imaginary mode appears,
|  6> #      watch whether it is a silanol rotation rather than the reacting coordinate.
|  7> # Gate: TERMINATED NORMALLY + 'THE OPTIMIZATION HAS CONVERGED' + 0 imaginary modes.
|  8> # Wall-time: the closest measured job (opt04 V-PRC, 30 atoms, 4 cores) took 9 h 52 m
|  9> #      for the optimisation alone; budget FREQ at 1.5-3x that. The 25-atom jobs are
| 10> #      roughly 3x cheaper. Run these before the OptTS jobs.
